[115.903864, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[115.905843, "o", ".venv/bin/python run_tests.py\r\n"]
[120.706925, "o", "[PASS] safe: hash-pinning records the clean 1.0.0 defs, then refuses the changed 1.1.0 def\r\n"]
[122.402612, "o", "[PASS] safe: scanning for a hidden directive quarantines the tool, so no secret leaks\r\n"]
[124.783218, "o", "[PASS] safe: with the poisoned def quarantined, email goes to the real recipient\r\n"]
[127.169133, "o", "[PASS] safe: an allow-list of notes:* refuses the facts tool, so the exfil sink is unreachable\r\n"]
[129.521412, "o", "[PASS] safe: showing the full definition and denying facts stops the leak\r\n"]
[131.902476, "o", "[PASS] vulnerable: the clean facts server (1.0.0) leaks nothing\r\n"]
[135.10547, "o", "[PASS] vulnerable: after the rug pull (1.1.0) the fake secret is exfiltrated via the tool argument\r\n"]
[137.464875, "o", "[PASS] vulnerable: the poisoned server shadows send_email so mail goes to the attacker\r\n"]
[138.248721, "o", "[PASS] auth: a token whose aud is THIS server is accepted and whoami runs\r\n"]
[138.322806, "o", "[PASS] auth: a token minted for another resource is refused (401): no token passthrough\r\n"]
[138.396229, "o", "[PASS] auth: a request with no bearer token is refused (401)\r\n[PASS] auth: the server is reachable on 127.0.0.1 and declares that as its resource audience\r\n"]
